The JSON files in this directory (and its subdirectories) are adapted from

  "Contested Ground: Solo Mode" 1.0, docs/solo_mode.qmd
  © 2026 Roberto Bisceglie
  https://github.com/openstrategygames/openstrategygames.github.io
  at commit 0d96334f1216f71c024c875ec2427eda97ccd97f

The Open Strategy Game format was defined by Chris McDowall, originating in the
Matrix Game tradition established by Chris Engle and Tom Mouat.

The original work is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
International (CC BY-SA 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

Changes: the tables and Appendix A scenario were converted to JSON, with the text
kept verbatim (Markdown emphasis removed) and machine-readable fields added (ids,
roll ranges, odds, leverage and behavior identifiers, effect tags, source
references). These adapted files are licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0 as well.

The code in this package (src/) is licensed MIT, like the rest of the repository.
